Overheat was added in '''Beta 42.0''' during the Bravery rework, replacing [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Acceleration Acceleration] as a 5G spell that kills an ally monster of your choice to deal its ATK as DMG to all enemy monsters. '''Beta 43.0''' decreased its cost to 4G.

=== Stats ===
SOUL Type: Bravery

Cost:
* 5 (Post Beta 42.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 43.0, Current)
Effect: Kill an ally monster. Deal its ATK as DMG to all enemy monsters.

Rarity: Purple (Epic)
